      ⍝ monadic ⎕INP
      ⍝
      Q←⎕INP 'END-OF-⎕INP'
Hello ⎕INP
Second Line
END-OF-⎕INP

      4 ⎕CR Q
┏→━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓
┃┏→━━━━━━━━━┓ ┏→━━━━━━━━━━┓┃
┃┃Hello ⎕INP┃ ┃Second Line┃┃
┃┗━━━━━━━━━━┛ ┗━━━━━━━━━━━┛┃
